Direct epsilon contractions: a*a=2a, a*b=b*a=a, b*b=b; d=b-a.
Projectors: primitive ranks 9+9+9; theta rank 1; sum = wedge-square projector.
Exact ranks: initial 5; S4-span 7; with compositions 8; geometric Koszul signs preserve rank.
Lefschetz-only closure: 3.
Symbolic certificate verified: d_ij=4(q_i-q_j)/3-2(Rq_i-Rq_j)/3=x_i-x_j.
Sum x_i = sum_{i<j} d_ij^2 - sum q_i + 3p; each x_i=(sum x + sum_{j!=i}d_ij)/3.
No finite check is claimed to prove the all-arity or algebraicity statements.
